// Boilerplate property map for Certora review.
// Convert to the exact Certora Prover syntax used by the project.
//
// After successful registration:
// - totalAudits increases by exactly one.
// - hashToAuditId(reportHash) remains non-empty.
// - audits[auditId].reportHash remains equal to reportHash.
// - audits[auditId].timestamp remains non-zero.
// - a second registration with the same reportHash reverts.
//
// These properties complement uniqueness.spec and require concrete ghost
// variables/selectors when translated into a runnable Certora specification.
